    <node id="n_bonny_betsy_0474112ba49c">
      <data key="d3">Bonny Betsy</data>
      <data key="d4">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d5">A bay mare mentioned as a competitor in the Durnstone Handicap. | Horse that Blore believes is bound to win the handicap, but the Dean disagrees. | A horse that Blore has backed with his savings and hopes will benefit if Dandy Dick is harmed. | A horse that walked in with the policeman. | A horse that walked in with the policeman, implying it did not win. | A horse that Blore placed the Dean's offering on. | Horse on which Blore put the mixture intended for Dandy.</data>
      <data key="d6">["A bay mare mentioned as a competitor in the Durnstone Handicap.","Horse that Blore believes is bound to win the handicap, but the Dean disagrees.","A horse that Blore has backed with his savings and hopes will benefit if Dandy Dick is harmed.","A horse that walked in with the policeman.","A horse that walked in with the policeman, implying it did not win.","A horse that Blore placed the Dean's offering on.","Horse on which Blore put the mixture intended for Dandy."]</data>
