    <node id="n_dandy_dick_98b7c47c5eaf">
      <data key="d3">Dandy Dick</data>
      <data key="d4">ANIMAL</data>
      <data key="d5">A horse owned by Sir Tristram Mardon, entered in the Durnstone Handicap with nine stone two and Tom Gallawood up. | A horse owned by Sir Tristram, located at The Swan Inn. | A horse that runs for the Durnstone Handicap. | A horse that Georgiana saw marched out before the auctioneer; she and Sir Tristram are partners in owning him. | A horse that Georgiana was discussing with a gentleman and on which Sheba and Salome hope to win money. | A horse that Georgiana has a betting interest in. | A horse that Georgiana is betting on, and whose feeding at the 'Swan' is being considered. | A horse that was in the fire at the Swan Inn, rescued by Sir Tristram. | A horse owned by Sir Tristram Mardon. | A horse that is being cared for at the Deanery; he is feeding well but has lost his tail. | A horse referred to as 'our Dandy' and described as proud and bereaved. | A horse that Georgiana believes is a certainty to win a race. | Horse in the Dean's stable, mentioned as a contender in the handicap race. | A horse in the Dean's stable that the Dean plans to treat with a bolus. | A horse in the stable that Blore intends to poison. | A horse that Blore says he has cooked. | A horse that Georgiana and Sir Tristram co-own, with Georgiana owning the tail end and Sir Tristram the head. | A horse referred to as 'our Dandy' by Georgiana. | A horse mentioned by Blore in connection with the stables and medicine. | A horse that was found dosed last night. | Horse that was dosed last night. | A horse that won the race. | A horse owned by Sir Tristram that won a race. | Racehorse owned jointly by the Dean, Sir Tristram, and Georgiana. | A horse owned by Sir Tristram and Georgiana. | Horse to which the Dean gave some mixture.</data>
      <data key="d6">["A horse owned by Sir Tristram Mardon, entered in the Durnstone Handicap with nine stone two and Tom Gallawood up.","A horse owned by Sir Tristram, located at The Swan Inn.","A horse that runs for the Durnstone Handicap.","A horse that Georgiana saw marched out before the auctioneer; she and Sir Tristram are partners in owning him.","A horse that Georgiana was discussing with a gentleman and on which Sheba and Salome hope to win money.","A horse that Georgiana has a betting interest in.","A horse that Georgiana is betting on, and whose feeding at the 'Swan' is being considered.","A horse that was in the fire at the Swan Inn, rescued by Sir Tristram.","A horse owned by Sir Tristram Mardon.","A horse that is being cared for at the Deanery; he is feeding well but has lost his tail.","A horse referred to as 'our Dandy' and described as proud and bereaved.","A horse that Georgiana believes is a certainty to win a race.","Horse in the Dean's stable, mentioned as a contender in the handicap race.","A horse in the Dean's stable that the Dean plans to treat with a bolus.","A horse in the stable that Blore intends to poison.","A horse that Blore says he has cooked.","A horse that Georgiana and Sir Tristram co-own, with Georgiana owning the tail end and Sir Tristram the head.","A horse referred to as 'our Dandy' by Georgiana.","A horse mentioned by Blore in connection with the stables and medicine.","A horse that was found dosed last night.","Horse that was dosed last night.","A horse that won the race.","A horse owned by Sir Tristram that won a race.","Racehorse owned jointly by the Dean, Sir Tristram, and Georgiana.","A horse owned by Sir Tristram and Georgiana.","Horse to which the Dean gave some mixture."]</data>
