      <data key="d4">LOCATION</data>
      <data key="d5">Place from which Major Tarver and Mr. Darbey have ridden over. | A place where the group plans to go, possibly for an event. | Town where Georgiana Tidman stayed at the Wheatsheaf inn. | A place where the military has been sent for to watch the ruins. | A place where Noah is to drive a prisoner, and where Noah was previously a policeman. | A place where Hannah married a policeman, and where the police station is located. | Destination where Noah is taking his prisoner. | A place described as cruel, to which the Constable is going to take the Dean. | A place the Dean is going to, where he hopes to avoid recognition. | A place where the Dean is to be taken; has a Fire Brigade. | The location of the police station where Noah works and where the Bench sets. | Location where the Bench sets, as mentioned by Hannah. | The place where the disappearance is to be reported. | Place where the scoundrel is to be taken. | A place to which Noah intends to drive the Dean. | Location of a fancy masked ball last night.</data>
