    <node id="n_st_marvells_minster_spire_99e4803e4bc5">
      <data key="d3">St. Marvells Minster Spire</data>
      <data key="d4">OBJECT</data>
      <data key="d5">A spire whose preservation is a concern for Dr. Jedd. | A church spire that needs restoration and is in danger of crumbling. | A structure that the Dean refers to as his principal creditor. | An object that may be richer by five hundred pounds if the Dean does not call Blore back. | A structure towards which the Dean plans to contribute five hundred pounds. | An object referred to as 'the poor, innocent old Spire' for which money is to be lent.</data>
      <data key="d6">["A spire whose preservation is a concern for Dr. Jedd.","A church spire that needs restoration and is in danger of crumbling.","A structure that the Dean refers to as his principal creditor.","An object that may be richer by five hundred pounds if the Dean does not call Blore back.","A structure towards which the Dean plans to contribute five hundred pounds.","An object referred to as 'the poor, innocent old Spire' for which money is to be lent."]</data>
