    <edge source="n_arthur_w_pinero_e79bd27a36a1" target="n_brighton_9a26e69ae1dd" id="e_n_arthur_w_pinero_e79bd27a36_126ad6377c810a">
      <data key="d9">e_n_arthur_w_pinero_e79bd27a36_126ad6377c810a</data>
      <data key="d10">Arthur W. Pinero</data>
      <data key="d11">Brighton</data>
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_AT</data>
      <data key="d13">True</data>
      <data key="d14">Mr. Pinero was working in Brighton when Mr. Clayton visited him.</data>
      <data key="d15">["Mr. Pinero was working in Brighton when Mr. Clayton visited him."]</data>
      <data key="d16">Mr. Pinero was under contract to supply its successor by a certain date, when Mr. Clayton one day went down to Brighton, where the dramatist was then at work</data>
      <data key="d17">dd_prod_c0001</data>
      <data key="d18">0.9</data>
      <data key="d19">[{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"Mr. Pinero was under contract to supply its successor by a certain date, when Mr. Clayton one day went down to Brighton, where the dramatist was then at work","source_chunk_id":"dd_prod_c0001"}]</data>
      <data key="d20">["dd_prod_c0001"]</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="n_augustin_jedd_6215e882c99f" target="n_sheba_jedd_77083cdc8c2f" id="e_n_augustin_jedd_6215e882c99f_110dc62ee818a1">
      <data key="d9">e_n_augustin_jedd_6215e882c99f_110dc62ee818a1</data>
      <data key="d10">Augustin Jedd</data>
      <data key="d11">Sheba Jedd</data>
      <data key="d12">PARENT_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">True</data>
      <data key="d14">Papa is the father of Salome and Sheba. | Papa is the father of Sheba, as she refers to him as 'Dear Papa'. | Sheba is the daughter of Papa, as she says 'They didn't even ask Papa's permission'. | Sheba is the daughter of the Dean. | Sheba refers to the Dean as 'poor dear Papa', indicating he is her father. | The Dean is Sheba's father, as she calls him Papsey. | The Dean is Sheba's father. | The Dean is the father of Sheba.</data>
      <data key="d15">["Papa is the father of Salome and Sheba.","Papa is the father of Sheba, as she refers to him as 'Dear Papa'.","Sheba is the daughter of Papa, as she says 'They didn't even ask Papa's permission'.","Sheba is the daughter of the Dean.","Sheba refers to the Dean as 'poor dear Papa', indicating he is her father.","The Dean is Sheba's father, as she calls him Papsey.","The Dean is Sheba's father.","The Dean is the father of Sheba."]</data>
      <data key="d16">THE DEAN. [_Embracing his daughters._] A second mother to my girls. She will implant the precepts of retrenchment if their father cannot! SALOME. But, Papa, who is Aunt what's-her-name? SHEBA</data>
      <data key="d17">dd_act01_c0009</data>
      <data key="d18">0.95</data>
      <data key="d19">[{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. [_Embracing his daughters._] A second mother to my girls. She will implant the precepts of retrenchment if their father cannot! SALOME. But, Papa, who is Aunt what's-her-name? SHEBA","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0009"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"SHEBA. No, no. Papa; we have accidentally discovered that you, our parent","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s02_c0009"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"SHEBA. And custards, Papsey.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0006"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"Papa, Papa! SALOME. Our own Papa! SHEBA","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s02_c0006"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"SHEBA. But we can't help that when _we're_ pressed for money--poor dear Papa!","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0003"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"SHEBA. We must get dear Papa in a good humor and coax him to make us a present of money.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0002"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. Salome, child, you and I will drive into Durnstone--we may be in time to bring your Aunt over. My hat, Sheba! Quick!","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0010"},{"confidence":0.8,"evidence_quote":"SHEBA. They didn't even ask Papa's permission!","source_chunk_id":"dd_act02_c0016"},{"confidence":0.8,"evidence_quote":"SHEBA. Dear Papa was as lively as an owl with neuralgia.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act02_c0001"},{"confidence":0.7,"evidence_quote":"Poor Papa looks worried. SHEBA","source_chunk_id":"dd_act02_c0006"}]</data>
      <data key="d20">["dd_act01_c0002","dd_act01_c0003","dd_act01_c0006","dd_act01_c0009","dd_act01_c0010","dd_act02_c0001","dd_act02_c0006","dd_act02_c0016","dd_act03s02_c0006","dd_act03s02_c0009"]</data>
