      <data key="d14">Dr. Jedd has subscribed one thousand pounds to the Restoration Fund. | The Dean instructed Blore to back Dandy Dick on behalf of the Restoration Fund.</data>
      <data key="d15">["Dr. Jedd has subscribed one thousand pounds to the Restoration Fund.","The Dean instructed Blore to back Dandy Dick on behalf of the Restoration Fund."]</data>
      <data key="d16">the Dean of St. Marvells, whose anxiety for the preservation of the Minister Spire threatens to undermine his health, has subscribed the munificent sum of one thousand pounds to the Restoration Fund</data>
      <data key="d17">dd_act01_c0008</data>
      <data key="d18">0.95</data>
      <data key="d19">[{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"the Dean of St. Marvells, whose anxiety for the preservation of the Minister Spire threatens to undermine his health, has subscribed the munificent sum of one thousand pounds to the Restoration Fund","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0008"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. I can conceal it no longer--I--I instructed this unworthy creature to back Dandy Dick on behalf of the Restoration Fund.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s02_c0008"}]</data>
