      <data key="d9">e_n_augustin_jedd_6215e882c99f_7d328ebce1e2bb</data>
      <data key="d10">Augustin Jedd</data>
      <data key="d11">Georgiana Tidman</data>
      <data key="d12">SIBLING_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">False</data>
      <data key="d14">Georgiana is the Dean's sister. | Georgiana is the sister of Augustin. | Georgiana is the sister of Dr. Jedd. | Georgiana is the sister of the Dean. | Georgiana refers to the Dean as her brother Gus. | Georgiana refers to the Dean as her brother. | The Dean and Georgiana Tidman are siblings. | The Dean and Georgiana are siblings. | The Dean is Georgiana Tidman's brother. | The Dean states that Georgiana is his sister.</data>
      <data key="d15">["Georgiana is the Dean's sister.","Georgiana is the sister of Augustin.","Georgiana is the sister of Dr. Jedd.","Georgiana is the sister of the Dean.","Georgiana refers to the Dean as her brother Gus.","Georgiana refers to the Dean as her brother.","The Dean and Georgiana Tidman are siblings.","The Dean and Georgiana are siblings.","The Dean is Georgiana Tidman's brother.","The Dean states that Georgiana is his sister."]</data>
      <data key="d16">THE DEAN. My dear widowed sister, Georgiana Tidman.</data>
      <data key="d17">dd_act01_c0009</data>
      <data key="d18">1.0</data>
      <data key="d19">[{"confidence":1.0,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. My dear widowed sister, Georgiana Tidman.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0009"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. [_Looking at GEORGIANA._] My sister!","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s02_c0007"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. [_With dignity._] My dear sister! GEORGIANA","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0011"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. Sir Tristram Mardon, Mrs. Tidman is my sister.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0014"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. My sister, Georgiana--my widowed sister, Georgiana.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0012"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"GEORGIANA. Tris! My brother Gus doesn't want us to be merry at his expense.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s02_c0011"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"This lady is Mrs. Tidman. Mrs. Tidman is the sister of Dr. Jedd, the Dean of St. Marvells.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s01_c0010"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"GEORGIANA. Going! I'm going to help clear the stables at The Swan! THE DEAN. Remember what you are--my sister--a lady!","source_chunk_id":"dd_act02_c0005"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. Left a widow, you would think it natural that Georgiana Tidman would have flown to her brother, himself a widower.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0010"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"GEORGIANA. Then it's a match between you and the spire which parts first. Gus, will you let your little sister lend you a hand?","source_chunk_id":"dd_act02_c0009"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"Augustin out of the cart by his legs! SIR TRISTRAM. Oh, but why mention such trifles? GEORGIANA. They're not trifles. And when his cap fell off, it was you--brave fellow that you are--who pulled the horse's nose-bag over my brother's head so that he shouldn't be recognized.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s02_c0005"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. I am ready! [_NOAH takes him by the arm and leads him out._ GEORGIANA. Oh, what am I to think of my brother?","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s01_c0013"}]</data>
      <data key="d20">["dd_act01_c0009","dd_act01_c0010","dd_act01_c0011","dd_act01_c0012","dd_act01_c0014","dd_act02_c0005","dd_act02_c0009","dd_act03s01_c0010","dd_act03s01_c0013","dd_act03s02_c0005","dd_act03s02_c0007","dd_act03s02_c0011"]</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="n_augustin_jedd_6215e882c99f" target="n_the_deanery_of_st_marvells_25cc7034d77b" id="e_n_augustin_jedd_6215e882c99f_80fb742f721095">
