      <data key="d11">The Deanery of St. Marvells</data>
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_AT</data>
      <data key="d13">True</data>
      <data key="d14">The Dean is associated with the Deanery, as indicated by the phrase 'the genial summer of the Deanery'. | The Dean is at the Deanery. | The Dean lives at the Deanery. | The Dean resides at the Deanery. | The Dean's home is the Deanery.</data>
      <data key="d15">["The Dean is associated with the Deanery, as indicated by the phrase 'the genial summer of the Deanery'.","The Dean is at the Deanery.","The Dean lives at the Deanery.","The Dean resides at the Deanery.","The Dean's home is the Deanery."]</data>
      <data key="d16">THE DEAN. My good woman, a single word from me to those at the Deanery, would instantly restore me to home, family, and accustomed diet</data>
      <data key="d17">dd_act03s01_c0006</data>
      <data key="d18">0.9</data>
      <data key="d19">[{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. My good woman, a single word from me to those at the Deanery, would instantly restore me to home, family, and accustomed diet","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s01_c0006"},{"confidence":0.8,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. I never play cards. SIR TRISTRAM. [_Slapping him on the back._] I'll teach you during my stay at the Deanery.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act02_c0008"},{"confidence":0.8,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. [_Advancing towards the table._] Oh, Hannah Topping--Hannah Topping! [_Clutching the carving-knife despairingly._] I'll have no more women cooks at the Deanery!","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s01_c0008"},{"confidence":0.8,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN Lock up; I'll speak to you in the morning. Lock up. [_BLORE goes into the Library, turns out the lamp there, and disappears._ What dreadful wave threatens to engulf the Deanery?","source_chunk_id":"dd_act02_c0010"},{"confidence":0.7,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. My sister, Georgiana--my widowed sister, Georgiana. Dear me, I am quite disturbed. Surely, surely the serene atmosphere of the Deanery","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0012"},{"confidence":0.7,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. Happy! My family influence gone forever--my dignity crushed out of all recognition--the genial summer of the Deanery frosted by the winter of Deceit","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s02_c0010"}]</data>
      <data key="d20">["dd_act01_c0012","dd_act02_c0008","dd_act02_c0010","dd_act03s01_c0006","dd_act03s01_c0008","dd_act03s02_c0010"]</data>
    </edge>
