      <data key="d15">["Papa is the father of Salome and Sheba.","Papa is the father of Salome, as she refers to him as 'Dear Papa'.","Salome is the daughter of Papa, as Sheba says 'They didn't even ask Papa's permission'.","Salome is the daughter of the Dean.","Salome refers to the Dean as 'poor dear Papa', indicating he is her father.","Salome refers to the Dean as her Papa.","Salome refers to the Dean as her father.","The Dean is Salome's father, as she calls him Papa.","The Dean is Salome's father.","The Dean is the father of Salome."]</data>
      <data key="d16">SALOME. Keep the expenses down! THE DEAN. [_Embracing his daughters._] A second mother to my girls.</data>
      <data key="d17">dd_act01_c0009</data>
      <data key="d18">0.95</data>
      <data key="d19">[{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"SALOME. Keep the expenses down! THE DEAN. [_Embracing his daughters._] A second mother to my girls.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0009"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"SALOME. Leg of mutton, Papa!","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0006"},{"confidence":0.95,"evidence_quote":"SALOME. Papa has been out all night.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s02_c0002"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"SALOME. Poor dear Papa!","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0003"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"SALOME. Condemn my Papa!","source_chunk_id":"dd_act03s02_c0003"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"SALOME. [_To SHEBA, in a whisper._] Papa's alone!","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0007"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"THE DEAN. Salome, child, you and I will drive into Durnstone","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0010"},{"confidence":0.9,"evidence_quote":"SALOME. Of course we'll do that, but--the bill! SHEBA. We must get dear Papa in a good humor and coax him to make us a present of money.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act01_c0002"},{"confidence":0.8,"evidence_quote":"SHEBA. They didn't even ask Papa's permission! SALOME","source_chunk_id":"dd_act02_c0016"},{"confidence":0.8,"evidence_quote":"SHEBA. Dear Papa was as lively as an owl with neuralgia. GEORGIANA. Major Tarver isn't a conversational cracker. SALOME","source_chunk_id":"dd_act02_c0001"},{"confidence":0.7,"evidence_quote":"SALOME. Yes, yes. [_Calling._] Papa, Major Tarver and Mr. Darbey must go.","source_chunk_id":"dd_act02_c0006"}]</data>
