      <data key="d15">["Blore has previously bet at St. Marvells Races."]</data>
      <data key="d16">THE DEAN. [_Catching him by the coat collar._] Man, what were you doing at St. Marvells Races last summer? BLORE. [_With a cry, falling on his knees._] Oh, sir! Oh, sir! I knew that 'igh-sperited lady would bring grief and sorrow to the peaceful, 'appy Deanery! Oh, sir, I _'ave_ done a little on my hown account from time to time on the 'ill, halso hon commission for the kitchen!</data>
